				<r3d:description language="eng">The team have established the CardiacAI Data Repository that brings large amounts of Australian healthcare data together in a secure environment with strict conditions for use of these data with an appropriate level of oversight of research activities.
The CardiacAI Data Repository collects de-identified EMR data about cardiovascular patients who are admitted to a group of urban and regional hospitals in NSW and links this with state-wide hospital and emergency deparment visit and mortality data and mobile-health remote monitoring data.</r3d:description>
